  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive). Intransitive pair: {取|と}り{付|つ}く.\n\nCOMPOUND VERB: Formed from {取|と}る (to take) + {付|つ}ける (to attach).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・エアコンを{取|と}り{付|つ}ける (install an air conditioner)\n・{棚|たな}を{取|と}り{付|つ}ける (install a shelf)\n・センサーを{取|と}り{付|つ}ける (install a sensor)\n・{約束|やくそく}を{取|と}り{付|つ}ける (secure a promise)\n・アポを{取|と}り{付|つ}ける (secure an appointment)\n\nRELATED: {取|と}り{外|はず}す (to remove/detach) is the opposite action.",
